/Title (We remove the in-memory NetworkX storage framework and route all operations directly to a native Neo4j instance. This decouples the graph topology from volatile system RAM and ensures persistent storage. Text profiling updates are converted into parameterized Cypher statements executed within transactional boundaries:)
