516 0 obj
<<
/Title (combined with Reciprocal Rank Fusion is designed to capture exact terms \(e.g., specific legal clauses or technical error codes\) that are often missed by dense vector search alone, increasing Context Recall. Latency Profiling: Shifting retrieval branches from a sequential loop to a parallelized architecture using asyncio is expected to reduce query processing latency, accelerating Time-To-First-Token \(TTFT\) metrics. Memory Management Optimization: While the original LightRAG model exhibits a linear increase in RAM usage during large-scale document ingestion due to its in-memory NetworkX graph, Enterprise-LightRAG offloads this overhead to a standalone Neo4j instance, stabilizing system memory footprint at scale.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 482 0 R
/Prev 515 0 R
>>
endobj
